  title: Level Mechanism
  tutorialPage:
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
    context: "Level Mechanism 1 \u2013 Locked Doors\r\nIn the level, there are locked
      doors that require finding a way to open them.\r\n"
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
    context: "Level Mechanism 2 \u2013 Buttons\r\nIn the level, there are some buttons.
      Interact with a button will trigger the corresponding level mechanism to react.\r\n"
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
    context: "Level Mechanism 3 \u2013 Guards\r\nIn the level, there are some special
      enemies called guards. Defeating them will unlock the corresponding locked
      doors.\r\n"
